  "facts": [
    {
      "text": "Spanning the majority of the Iberian Peninsula, its territory also includes the Canary Islands, in the Eastern Atlantic Ocean; the Balearic Islands, in the Western Mediterranean Sea; and the autonomous cities of Ceuta and Melilla, in mainland Africa.",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spain",
