      "supersedes": null,
      "contradicted_by": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Peninsular Spain is bordered to the north by France, Andorra, and the Bay of Biscay; to the east and south by the Mediterranean Sea, Gibraltar and Morocco ; and to the west by Portugal and the Atlantic Ocean.",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Spain",
      "source_type": "reference_work",
